      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### H3 Smart: what the pieces do\n**System Advisor** reads your GPU/RAM/flags and installed H3 files and prints advice (queue it once).\n**Budget Planner** turns aspect + megapixels + seconds into width/height/frames and shrinks the request if the\nestimated VRAM exceeds your budget.\n**Cached Conditioning** is the native H3 conditioning node with an on-disk cache: an unchanged prompt/frames/size\nskips the 15 GB text encoder entirely, even with `--cache-none`.\n**Sampling Setup** picks the matching Turbo LoRA + steps + official sampler/scheduler in one node.\n**Memory Barrier** (x2) drops the text encoder before the DiT loads, and the DiT before VAE decode.\n\n**REF2VA** needs the `ref2va` diffusion checkpoint and the 4-step REF2VA Turbo LoRA (`minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_...`). Never mix FL2VA and REF2VA files. Reference tokens ride through every step, so keep `ref_image_size` on `match` on 8 GB cards. Tell the planner how many references you use."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
